All three documents are written and validate cleanly. Here are the top-level tasks:

1. **Project scaffold and tooling** — Vite/React/TypeScript setup, core type stubs, registry stubs, scripts
2. **ByteReader and ByteWriter** — bounds-checked reads that auto-annotate; growable writer
3. **Code pages and PackBits** — CP437/850/1252/MacRoman lookups; shared PackBits codec + P5 round-trip property
4. **MCP server skeleton** — `identify` and `hexdump` tools over stdio (usable by agents from task 5 onward)
5. **MacPaint format module** — MacBinary wrapper, 512-byte header, PackBits bitmap + P1–P4
6. **PCX format module** — all 6 pixel layouts, RLE decoder/encoder + P1–P4, P6 RLE round-trip
7. **IFF ILBM format module** — IFF container, all colour modes (indexed/EHB/HAM6/24-plane) + P1–P4
8. **dBASE DBF format module** — header + field descriptors + all field types + code-page routing + P1–P4
9. **Lotus WK1 — values and structure** — record stream, format byte, label prefixes, date serials + P1–P4
10. **Lotus WK1 — formula decompiler and Excel translator** — full opcode table, relative/absolute refs, function mapping + P8
11. **WordStar format module** — high-bit processing, control toggles, dot commands, heuristic detect + P1–P4
12. **Samples generator** — `npm run samples` builds all six original specimens into `public/samples/`
13. **UI shell and Graveyard** — theme CSS, routing, six tombstones, drop zone, aria-live status
14. **Image Viewer** — pixelated canvas, integer zoom, period frames
15. **Sheet Viewer** — green-phosphor grid, formula bar, all format-byte value types
16. **Table Viewer** — dBASE dot-prompt frame, deleted-row strikethrough + toggle
17. **Document Viewer** — inline runs (bold/italic/underline/etc.), page breaks, fan-fold frame
18. **Autopsy view** — HexPane + AnnotationTree, bidirectional byte↔span selection
19. **Export — PNG and CSV** — custom PNG writer, RFC 4180 CSV + P7 round-trip, ExportBar, CornerReport
20. **Export — XLSX and formula translation** — minimal fflate-based XLSX, Lotus→Excel translation + P9
21. **Export — JSON, Markdown, HTML, text** — remaining reincarnation targets
22. **MCP autopsy and decode tools** — `autopsy` and `decode` tools complete the MCP server
23. **Offline / PWA, accessibility pass, deploy workflow** — service worker, privacy notice, a11y audit, GitHub Actions deploy
